{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And he moved from there.</b> His tent." "<b>East of Bethel.</b> On its east side — you find that Bethel is on its west, as it says ״בֵּית אֵל מִיָּם״ (Joshua 16:7 — 'Bethel on the west')." "<b>His tent.</b> אָהֳלָה is written — at first he pitched his wife's tent, and afterwards his own (Bereshit Rabbah)." "<b>And he built there an altar.</b> He prophesied that his sons were destined to stumble there on account of the sin of Achan, and he prayed there on their behalf."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:58:23.400261925Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}